{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1Rhbm5hJTIwJTI4MjAxNSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Tanna","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/iKk0Nu3dytbDzX1SFwYJvUreQW.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oKMLvGOlEl7BVRHHJxH7NE3W8gc.jpg","description":"In a traditional tribal society in the South Pacific, a young girl, Wawa, falls in love with her chief’s grandson, Dain. When an inter-tribal war escalates, Wawa is unknowingly betrothed as part of a peace deal. The young lovers run away, refusing her arranged fate. They must choose between their hearts and the future of the tribe, while the villagers must wrestle with preserving their traditional culture and adapting it to the increasing outside demands for individual freedom.","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["Romance","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.6","runtime":"104 min","cast":["Mungau Dain","Marie Wawa","Marceline Rofit","Kapan Cook","Charlie Kahla","Lingai Kowia","Dadwa Mungau","Albi Nagia"],"director":["Martin Butler","Bentley Dean"],"released":"2015-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Two tribes. One love.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Mungau Dain","character":"Dain"},{"name":"Marie Wawa","character":"Wawa","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dZeh9LPqvPpwJxH1k2ejMxNd8Gd.jpg"},{"name":"Marceline Rofit","character":"Selin"},{"name":"Kapan Cook","character":"Kapan Cook"},{"name":"Charlie Kahla","character":"Chief Charlie"},{"name":"Lingai Kowia","character":"Father"},{"name":"Dadwa Mungau","character":"Grandmother"},{"name":"Albi Nagia","character":"Grandfather and Shaman"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"LnR8pUoPJZU","type":"Trailer"}],"trailerStreams":[{"title":"Trailer","ytId":"LnR8pUoPJZU"}]}}